  "description": "WIVBOS crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H124 O8 P4 Si8 Yb4,4(C4 H10 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1G (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1F (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.607-3.937 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.74-110.07°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H124O8P4Si8Yb4·4(C4H10O). Article name explicitly identifies Yb(II).",
